.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt DTRACE_DISABLE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace_disable
.Nd disable a DTrace probe
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn dtrace_disable probe
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm clears the enabled bit for
.Fa probe .
When no probe remains enabled the consumer event is released.
Records already in the rings stay readable.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EINVAL
The probe identifier is unknown.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
